OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 16 DEC
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GStep into Vienna's golden age of
OL,11,     Gthe waltz with a live concert
OL,12,     Gfrom the BBC Philharmonic
OL,13,     GOrchestra and Mark Forrest
OL,14,     Gintroduces music from the Belfast
OL,15,     GInternational Arts Festival.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Prokofiev
OL,17,     GKate Molleson follows Prokofiev
OL,18,     Gfrom bleak classrooms to a prize-
OL,19,     Gwinning triumph - and a storybook
OL,20,     Gending.
